# ---- Raw API caches ----
# These are committed deliberately. They are the only record of what ChEMBL, BindingDB and
# PubChem returned on the retrieval dates, and the live APIs will not return the same rows
# after the next release. Without them the endpoint tables cannot be regenerated at all.
# ---- Logs, backups, scratch ----
logs/
*.log
*.bak
*.lowercase_bak
*.pre_druggability_bak
*.all529_bak
_*.py
# ...except the three model entry points. They are not scratch: they are the only
# recorded way Nav1_7, OX1/OX2, TAAR1, GluA2 and Nav1_1 were produced, and ignoring
# them meant those models could not be regenerated from a clone at all.
!src/sai_cns/models/_train_nav17.py
!src/sai_cns/models/_train_ox.py
!src/sai_cns/models/_train_small.py
